@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam linetype polyline
hide empty description

[*] --> Pending : the student did the activity, with its time
Pending --> Graded : the time came and the grade was saved
Pending --> Failed : the time came and nobody could grade
Pending --> Manual : a teacher graded first
Pending --> Cancelled : the work was undone, the student left or Autograder went off
Pending --> Pending : an override or an extension moves the time
Graded --> [*]
Failed --> [*]
Manual --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]

note right of Cancelled
  A decision that is not pending is kept
  until the history is purged; a new one
  is planned if the student does the work again.
end note

@enduml
